{
  "slug": "smart-compact",
  "name": "Smart Compact",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Save structured session context before /clear and auto-restore it next session. Smart Compact captures what was done, why, decisions made, problems solved, and next steps — so you never  lose conversation context again. Includes a SessionStart hook that auto-detects saved context and prompts to reload it.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `smart-compact` (Use when the user says /smart-compact, wants to save session context before clearing, or asks to save what…) and **1 hook**, `SessionStart`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install smart-compact@claude-community` from `Omacatl94/smart-compact`.",
